    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000144 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000144">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000015"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000111 xml:lang="en">process profile</obo:IAO_0000111>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">B is a process_profile =Def. there is some process c such that b process_profile_of c

(Elucidation): b process_profile_of c holds when b proper_occurrent_part_of c&amp; there is some proper_occurrent_part d of c which has no parts in common with b &amp; is mutually dependent on b&amp; is such that b, c and d occupy the same temporal region</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000119 xml:lang="en">http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo.owl</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">process profile</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
</rdf:RDF>



